    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114467" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορο-ποιός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>instituting</i> or
				<i>arranging a chorus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Ages.</u>
				2.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				14.82
			</span></i>* (prob. a forgery). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in Poets, <i>leading the dance,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ θεῶν χοροποί᾽ ἄναξ,</span> of Pan,
				<i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Aj.</u>
				698
			</span></i> (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χάριτες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					788
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἥβα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ra.</u>
					353
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυσίαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					917
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαροποιός</span> is found
			in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ph.</u>
			</span></i> l.c. and v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Hec.</u>
			</span></i> l.c.</div>
